          <h3 class="faq__question">What is the minimum order quantity for an ecommerce clothing brand?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            The minimum order quantity for ecommerce clothing brands is typically 300 pieces per style. This quantity allows you to test market demand without excessive inventory risk while maintaining viable production costs. At SDF Clothing, we specialize in 300-piece MOQs specifically designed for Shopify and DTC brands who need to validate products before scaling.
          </p>
