        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Can you help with custom packaging for DTC brands?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Yes, we provide comprehensive DTC packaging solutions including woven neck labels ($0.10-0.30 each), hang tags ($0.05-0.15), individual polybags ($0.02-0.08), custom mailer boxes ($0.80-2.50), care labels with QR codes, and branded tissue paper. Packaging is critical for ecommerce unboxing experience and directly impacts customer reviews. We help you design packaging that reinforces your brand while staying within your budget.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What happens if I need to reorder quickly after a product sells out?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            When a product sells out, fast reorders are essential for ecommerce brands. Established relationships with your manufacturer enable priority production scheduling. At SDF Clothing, we offer expedited reorder timelines for existing clients - typically 6-8 weeks instead of the standard 12-16 weeks because we already have your tech pack, approved samples, and fabric sources on file. Keep fabric in stock for your bestsellers to enable even faster turnaround.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Do I need a tech pack to work with your factory?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            While a tech pack is ideal for accurate production, we can work with you if you don't have one. Our team offers tech pack development services to create professional technical specifications from your sketches or reference photos. A good tech pack includes measurements, fabric specifications, construction details, and color references. Well-prepared tech packs reduce sampling rounds and ensure your vision translates accurately to finished garments.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">How do tariffs affect the cost of manufacturing for US ecommerce brands?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Tariffs significantly impact your landed costs and margins. China faces Section 301 tariffs adding 25% to landed costs, while Bangladesh benefits from MFN (Most Favored Nation) status with standard 16.5% duties. For example, a $9 FOB hoodie from China becomes $13.89 landed with tariffs, while the same $9 FOB from Bangladesh lands at $11.64. On 300 units, that's $675 less cost with Bangladesh - directly improving your ecommerce margins.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Can I sell on Amazon using your manufactured clothing?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Yes, you can sell on Amazon using clothing manufactured by SDF. Amazon requires compliant labeling, accurate product descriptions, and adherence to their seller policies. We provide all necessary documentation including certificates of origin, fabric composition reports, and care label compliance. Many of our clients successfully sell on both their Shopify stores and Amazon, using manufacturing from the same production runs across both channels.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What certifications do your garments have for selling in the EU?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Our garments hold certifications required for EU markets including REACH compliance for chemical safety, OEKO-TEX Standard 100 for harmful substance testing, GOTS for organic cotton, and BSCI for social compliance. We provide transaction certificates and compliance documentation for customs clearance. EU regulations are strict, and our certified manufacturing ensures your products meet all requirements for selling in European markets. Learn more about our <a href="/certifications">complete certifications</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        </div>
    </div>
  </section>

